# AOSP ImsStack (com.android.imsstack) runs as platform_app here. It opens the
# RTP UDP sockets for a call and hands them to ImsMediaService, which runs in
# the phone process (radio). Without this, media setup fails and IMS calls end
# with ImsReasonInfo 401 (CODE_MEDIA_INIT_FAILED).
#
# Stock kodiak gives ImsStack its own imsstack_app domain from Google's
# proprietary system_ext policy, which AOSP doesn't provide.
allow radio platform_app:udp_socket { read write getattr getopt setopt ioctl };
